The public relay URL is not in c2c --help or c2c relay --help; it was found by reading source. Yet c2c relay setup --show already returns it as configured, which is inconsistent. Put the default relay URL plus how-to-configure instructions in relay setup --help and docs, and add a cross-machine pointer to top-level GETTING STARTED. Source: friction-points-cn.md (also Max note: need info about default relay + how to configure it).